{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-10",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "世界をあっと言わせたい  (I Want to Astonish the World)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "driver": "配達員",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "reika": "麗華"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At their next outdoor location, the lead actress stays upset with her manager until the makeup artist urges Muranishi to listen to her honestly, just as he did with Kuroki. Let's listen in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし、本番いこう！彼女は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "まだマネジャーと話してます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんなこといいから連れてこい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "監督、女優の意見もちゃんと聞いてあげてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "日本と違って、海外の女性はちゃんと自分の意見を主張するんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "黒木ちゃんとの撮影の時みたいに、彼女ともちゃんと向き合ってあげてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はね、君を尊敬しているんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんな君と、世界をあっと言わせたいんだ、俺は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "プロの女優として、監督であるあなたの注文には応えるって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "がっかりさせないでよって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろんだ。よーし、本番いこう！アクション！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "カット！パーフェクト！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし、本番いこう！彼女は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, let's roll a take! Where is she?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "まだマネジャーと話してます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She's still talking with her manager.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんなこといいから連れてこい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Never mind that, just bring her over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "監督、女優の意見もちゃんと聞いてあげてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, please listen properly to your actress's opinions too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "日本と違って、海外の女性はちゃんと自分の意見を主張するんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unlike in Japan, women overseas state their own opinions clearly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "黒木ちゃんとの撮影の時みたいに、彼女ともちゃんと向き合ってあげてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just like when you filmed with Kuroki, please face her sincerely too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はね、君を尊敬しているんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You know, I truly respect you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんな君と、世界をあっと言わせたいんだ、俺は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Together with you, I want to make the whole world gasp in amazement.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "プロの女優として、監督であるあなたの注文には応えるって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She says as a professional actress, she'll meet your requests as director.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "がっかりさせないでよって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And she says don't disappoint her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろんだ。よーし、本番いこう！アクション！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course not. Alright, let's go for a take! Action!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "カット！パーフェクト！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cut! Perfect!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし、本番いこう！彼女は？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "まだマネジャーと話してます。",
      "gap": 0.5
